      "gate": "No licence or terms of use is stated for the service (the ArcGIS item's licenseInfo is empty; the county website's Disclaimer page disclaims accuracy and liability and says nothing about reuse). A person must decide whether a public record published with no stated terms (Ohio R.C. 149.43) can be redistributed, or ask the Fiscal Officer (publicrequest@cuyahogacounty.us) to confirm the open-data terms of the Open Data Parcels service. The county's data hub (geospatial.gis.cuyahogacounty.gov) has robots.txt Crawl-delay 60 and was not read beyond its landing page.",
