      "reviewed": "2026-11-03",
      "notes": "ArcGIS Server map service Open_Data_Parcels/MapServer: layer 0 'Combined Parcels - Cleveland Only' (163,096 parcels) and layer 1 'Combined Parcels - Non-Cleveland Only' (358,344); maxRecordCount 2000. The files are 18 pages (OBJECTID order, geometry off) of the parcels whose property_class is C (commercial) or I (industrial): 17,311 in layer 0 and 16,971 in layer 1. Owner = deeded_owner (grantee/grantor/mail_name also present), situs par_addr_all, Ohio land use code tax_luc (4-digit: 4010-4090 apartments, 4xxx commercial, 3xxx industrial), certified values (certified_tax_*, gross_certified_*), building area and living units. gis.cuyahogacounty.gov serves no robots.txt (404). The old data-cuyahoga.opendata.arcgis.com hub says it moved to geospatial.gis.cuyahogacounty.gov."
